<color:#686868>[traceparent=00-e41de4ecbdf045c91032738d3ecfa309-569f458d800cc2d3-01]
end note
dessertProvider -[#438DD5]-> caller: OK
note right
{
  "flour": "Some_Flour"
}
end note
end

hnote across <<stepDelimiter>> #black:<color:white>BUT The request body is missing eggs


hnote across <<stepDelimiter>> #black:<color:white>WHEN The request is sent to the cake post endpoint

caller -[#438DD5]> dessertProvider: [[#iflow-8b047fa5-1ccb-4d36-8727-c6fc8077dfb4 POST: /cake]]
note left
<color:#686868>[traceparent=00-e41de4ecbdf045c91032738d3ecfa309-569f458d800cc2d3-01]

{
  "milk": "Some_Fresh_Milk",
  "flour": "Some_Flour"
}
end note
dessertProvider -[#438DD5]-> caller: Bad Request
note right
{
  "type": "https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc9110#section-15.5.1",
  "title": "One or more validation errors occurred.",
  "status": 400,
  "errors": {
    "Eggs": [
      "The Eggs field is required."
    ]
  },
  "traceId": "00-e41de4ecbdf045c91032738d3ecfa309-b5c3534f5d5ad067-01"
}
